---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Work With Us"
  description="How working with Monadic Labs works, for contractors and collaborators."
>
  <section class="container mx-auto max-w-2xl px-5 py-16 sm:py-20">
    <p class="font-mono text-sm text-blue-400">~/join$</p>
    <h1 class="mt-2 font-display text-3xl font-semibold sm:text-4xl">Work with us</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-muted">
      Monadic Labs occasionally brings in outside engineers for project-specific
      work — a PCB layout pass, a firmware sprint, a mechanical design push. If
      that's you, here's how it works.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-10 space-y-8">
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold">How you get paid</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted">
          Fixed scope of work, agreed rate, invoiced against milestones. No
          equity-only arrangements, no "exposure."
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold">What we look for</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted">
          Specific, demonstrable work in one of firmware, PCB design, mechanical
          design, or backend/cloud engineering. Show us something you've shipped.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 rounded-md border border-line bg-panel p-6">
      <h2 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold">Get in touch</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted">
        Send a short note and a link to work you've done to
        <a href="mailto:hello@monadiclabs.com" class="accent-link">hello@monadiclabs.com</a>.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-3 text-xs text-muted">Placeholder page — expand with real hiring details before launch.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
